&lt;p&gt;offtop to this issue: could you please share your experience how to run multiple launches? As far as I know, if you run one build configuration few times they will be merged and only 1 will be in a queue. Did you use REST API?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;About this issue: I see 40 launces and 6 execution timeouts in pull/2322/head. This problably related to this issue and probably not. Each of this timeouts requires detailed full build log investigation to find out which  was last &quot;started test&quot; which testh was hang up. Probability declared in this issue (10%) likes similar as current results.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
